{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03000","headline":"感遇十二首 十二 · 张九龄","name":"感遇十二首 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闭门迹羣化，凭林结所思。\n啸叹此寒木，畴昔乃芳蕤。\n朝阳凤安在，日暮蝉独悲。\n浩思极中夜，深嗟欲待谁。\n所怀诚已矣，既往不可追。\n鼎食非吾事，云仙尝我期。\n胡越方杳杳，车马何迟迟。\n天壤一何异，幽嘿卧帘帷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}